# MANDIBLES: red ants beeline for food and turn for home the moment they
# pick up a bead, even with you right there; they go for you only when
# their jaws are empty. When the food is gone they march on your queen.
game mandibles
wait 5
cheat mission 1 18
cheat clear
cheat red_store 0
cheat store 1
cheat mistakes 0
cheat at 200 60
cheat unit 2 1 230 60
cheat bead 226 60
wait 60
expect t0_carry == 1
wait 200
expect t0_x > 240
expect hp == 3
# no food anywhere: straight for the blue queen (at 52,68)
cheat tag_remove 0
cheat at 300 140
cheat unit 2 1 200 60
wait 700
expect t1_x < 120
